-- What the core 2nd-level spells do, in a sentence or three of our own words. Shown
-- in place of the bare facts a spell's entry is built from (see Data/SpellSummaries.lua).
local _, ns = ...
local R = ns.Rules

R.SPELL_SUMMARIES = R.SPELL_SUMMARIES or {}
local S = R.SPELL_SUMMARIES

S["Aid"] = "Up to three creatures within 30 feet gain 5 hit points, both current and maximum, for 8 hours. 5 more for each slot level above 2nd."
S["Alter Self"] = "For up to an hour you reshape your body: gills and a swim speed, a different appearance, or natural weapons that deal 1d6 and use your spellcasting ability. An action swaps to another option."
S["Animal Messenger"] = "A Tiny beast within 30 feet carries a message of up to 25 words to a place you know and a person you describe, travelling for a day. Only a beast of challenge rating 0 can fail the Charisma save. Two more days for each slot level above 2nd."
S["Arcane Lock"] = "A door, window, gate or container you touch is locked until dispelled, and no mundane means can open it. You and the creatures you name pass freely, and you can set a password."
S["Arcane Vigor"] = "Bonus action. You spend one or two of your Hit Dice and regain the roll plus your spellcasting modifier. One more die for each slot level above 2nd."
S["Augury"] = "You ask whether something you plan to do in the next 30 minutes will go well, and get an omen: good, bad, both or neither. Each further casting before a long rest has a growing chance of no answer."
S["Barkskin"] = "Bonus action. For an hour a willing creature you touch has an Armor Class of 17 if its own is lower."
S["Beast Sense"] = "For up to an hour you see, hear and smell through a willing beast you touch, as well as through your own senses."
S["Blindness/Deafness"] = "A creature within 120 feet that fails a Constitution save is blinded or deafened (your choice) for a minute. It saves again at the end of each of its turns. One more target for each slot level above 2nd."
S["Blur"] = "For up to a minute, attack rolls against you have disadvantage, unless the attacker doesn't rely on sight to perceive you."
S["Calm Emotions"] = "Humanoids in a 20-foot sphere within 60 feet that fail a Charisma save either stop being charmed or frightened, or become indifferent to creatures they were hostile to, for up to a minute. Harming them or their allies ends the indifference."
S["Cloud of Daggers"] = "Spinning blades fill a 5-foot cube within 60 feet for up to a minute. A creature there when it appears, or that enters or ends its turn there, takes 4d4 slashing damage, once per turn and with no save. An action moves it 30 feet. 2d4 more for each slot level above 2nd."
S["Continual Flame"] = "A heatless flame as bright as a torch springs from an object you touch and burns until dispelled. It can be covered but not put out."
S["Cordon of Arrows"] = "Four arrows or bolts planted at your feet guard the spot for 8 hours. A creature you haven't spared that comes within 30 feet or ends its turn there is shot by one: 2d4 piercing damage unless it passes a Dexterity save. Two more pieces for each slot level above 2nd."
S["Crown of Madness"] = "A humanoid within 120 feet that fails a Wisdom save is charmed for up to a minute and must spend its action attacking a creature you pick. You must spend your action each turn to keep control, and it saves again at the end of each of its turns."
S["Darkness"] = "Magical darkness fills a 15-foot sphere within 60 feet, or spreads from an object you cast it on, for up to 10 minutes. Darkvision can't see through it and ordinary light can't brighten it."
S["Darkvision"] = "A willing creature you touch sees in the dark out to 150 feet for 8 hours."
S["Detect Thoughts"] = "For up to a minute you can sense thinking minds within 30 feet, or read the surface thoughts of one creature you can see. Probing deeper lets the target make a Wisdom save; on a failure you learn its reasoning and what weighs on it."
S["Dragon's Breath"] = "Bonus action. For up to a minute a willing creature you touch can use its action to breathe a 15-foot cone of acid, cold, fire, lightning or poison: 3d6 damage, half on a successful Dexterity save. 1d6 more for each slot level above 2nd."
S["Enhance Ability"] = "A creature you touch has advantage on checks with one ability of your choice, other than Constitution, for up to an hour. One more target for each slot level above 2nd."
S["Enlarge/Reduce"] = "A creature or loose object within 30 feet grows or shrinks by one size for up to a minute. Enlarged, it has advantage on Strength checks and saves and its weapons deal 1d4 more; reduced, disadvantage and 1d4 less. An unwilling creature can resist with a Constitution save."
S["Enthrall"] = "Creatures you choose within 60 feet that fail a Wisdom save take a -10 penalty to Perception checks and passive Perception for up to a minute. Anyone you or your companions are fighting passes automatically."
S["Find Steed"] = "You summon a loyal otherworldly mount, Large and shaped like an animal of your choice, that fights at your side and stays until it drops to 0 hit points or you cast the spell again. A higher slot makes it stronger."
S["Find Traps"] = "You learn whether any trap lies within 120 feet in your line of sight and what kind of danger it poses, but not where it is."
S["Flame Blade"] = "Bonus action. A blade of fire appears in your free hand for up to 10 minutes. As an action you make a melee spell attack with it for 3d6 fire damage plus your spellcasting modifier. 1d6 more for each slot level above 2nd."
S["Flaming Sphere"] = "A 5-foot ball of fire appears within 60 feet for up to a minute. A creature that ends its turn within 5 feet of it, or that you roll it into, takes 2d6 fire damage, half on a successful Dexterity save. A bonus action moves it 30 feet. 1d6 more for each slot level above 2nd."
S["Gentle Repose"] = "A corpse you touch doesn't decay and can't become undead for 10 days. Those days don't count against the time limit for raising it."
S["Gust of Wind"] = "Wind blows in a line 60 feet long and 10 feet wide from you for up to a minute. Creatures in it that fail a Strength save are pushed 15 feet away, and moving towards you costs double. A bonus action turns the line."
S["Heat Metal"] = "A metal object within 60 feet glows red-hot for up to a minute: a creature touching it takes 2d8 fire damage, and again whenever you spend a bonus action. A creature holding or wearing it must pass a Constitution save or drop it; if it can't, it has disadvantage on attacks and checks. 1d8 more for each slot level above 2nd."
S["Hold Person"] = "A humanoid within 60 feet that fails a Wisdom save is paralyzed for up to a minute. It saves again at the end of each of its turns. One more target for each slot level above 2nd."
S["Invisibility"] = "A creature you touch is invisible for up to an hour, until it attacks, deals damage or casts a spell. One more target for each slot level above 2nd."
S["Knock"] = "An object within 60 feet that is locked, stuck or barred opens, one lock at a time, with a knock heard 300 feet away. A magical lock is only suppressed for 10 minutes."
S["Lesser Restoration"] = "Bonus action. Your touch ends one condition on a creature: blinded, deafened, paralyzed or poisoned."
S["Levitate"] = "A creature or a loose object of up to 500 pounds within 60 feet rises up to 20 feet and hangs there for up to 10 minutes; you can raise or lower it on your turn. An unwilling creature resists with a Constitution save."
S["Locate Animals or Plants"] = "You name a kind of beast or plant and learn the direction and distance to the nearest one within 5 miles."
S["Locate Object"] = "For up to 10 minutes you sense the direction to an object you know, or to the nearest object of a kind, within 1,000 feet. Lead blocks it."
S["Magic Mouth"] = "You store a message of up to 25 words in an object within 30 feet. A mouth appears and speaks it when the trigger you set happens, once or every time, as you choose."
S["Magic Weapon"] = "Bonus action. A nonmagical weapon you touch has +1 to attack and damage rolls for an hour. +2 with a slot of 3rd to 5th level, +3 with 6th or higher."
S["Melf's Acid Arrow"] = "A ranged spell attack at a target within 90 feet. A hit deals 4d4 acid damage now and 2d4 at the end of the target's next turn; a miss still deals half of the first amount. 1d4 more to both for each slot level above 2nd."
S["Mind Spike"] = "A creature within 120 feet takes 3d8 psychic damage, half on a successful Wisdom save. If it fails, you know where it is for up to an hour: it can't hide from you or gain anything from being invisible. 1d8 more for each slot level above 2nd."
S["Mirror Image"] = "Three illusory copies of you share your space for a minute. When an attack hits you, roll a d6 for each copy left: on any 3 or higher a copy is destroyed in your place."
S["Misty Step"] = "Bonus action. You teleport up to 30 feet to an empty space you can see."
S["Moonbeam"] = "A beam of pale light, 5 feet in radius, shines within 120 feet for up to a minute. A creature in it when it appears, or that enters or ends its turn there, takes 2d10 radiant damage, half on a successful Constitution save; a shapechanger that fails is forced into its true form. An action moves the beam 60 feet. 1d10 more for each slot level above 2nd."
S["Nystul's Magic Aura"] = "For 24 hours you disguise how magic reads a creature or object you touch: a creature counts as another creature type, an object seems magical or mundane as you choose."
S["Pass without Trace"] = "For up to an hour you and the creatures you choose within 30 feet of you have +10 to Stealth checks and leave no tracks."
S["Phantasmal Force"] = "A creature within 60 feet that fails an Intelligence save sees an illusion only it perceives, up to a 10-foot cube, and treats it as real for up to a minute. A dangerous phantasm deals 2d8 psychic damage to it on each of your turns. Studying it with an Investigation check ends the spell."
S["Prayer of Healing"] = "Takes 10 minutes. Up to five creatures within 30 feet gain the benefits of a short rest and regain 2d8 hit points, once each per long rest. 1d8 more for each slot level above 2nd."
S["Protection from Poison"] = "Your touch ends the poisoned condition on a creature. For an hour it resists poison damage and has advantage on saves against being poisoned."
S["Ray of Enfeeblement"] = "A creature within 60 feet that fails a Constitution save has disadvantage on Strength rolls and deals 1d8 less damage for up to a minute, saving again at the end of each of its turns. On a success it only has disadvantage on its next attack."
S["Rope Trick"] = "A rope you touch rises and opens an invisible doorway to a small pocket space that holds eight creatures for an hour. Nothing can attack or cast into or out of it; everyone falls out when it ends."
S["Scorching Ray"] = "Three rays of fire at one target or several within 120 feet, each a ranged spell attack for 2d6 fire damage. One more ray for each slot level above 2nd. The sheet rolls them all."
S["See Invisibility"] = "For an hour you see invisible creatures and objects as if they were visible, and you see into the Ethereal Plane."
S["Shatter"] = "A deafening burst in a 10-foot sphere within 60 feet: 3d8 thunder damage, half on a successful Constitution save. Constructs save with disadvantage, and loose objects take the damage too. 1d8 more for each slot level above 2nd."
S["Shining Smite"] = "Bonus action right after you hit with a melee weapon or unarmed strike: 2d6 extra radiant damage. For up to a minute the target glows, can't benefit from being invisible, and attacks against it have advantage. 1d6 more for each slot level above 2nd."
S["Silence"] = "No sound can be made in or pass through a 20-foot sphere within 120 feet for up to 10 minutes. Creatures inside are deafened and immune to thunder damage, and spells with spoken words can't be cast there."
S["Spider Climb"] = "For up to an hour a willing creature you touch can walk on walls and ceilings with its hands free, and has a climb speed equal to its speed. One more target for each slot level above 2nd."
S["Spike Growth"] = "The ground in a 20-foot radius within 150 feet sprouts hidden thorns for up to 10 minutes. It is difficult terrain, and a creature takes 2d4 piercing damage for every 5 feet it moves there."
S["Spiritual Weapon"] = "Bonus action. A floating weapon of force appears within 60 feet for up to a minute and makes a melee spell attack for 1d8 force damage plus your spellcasting modifier. On later turns a bonus action moves it 20 feet and attacks again. 1d8 more for each slot level above 2nd."
S["Suggestion"] = "You give a reasonable-sounding course of action, in 25 words or fewer, to a creature within 30 feet that understands you. If it fails a Wisdom save it is charmed and follows it for up to 8 hours, or until you or your allies damage it."
S["Summon Beast"] = "A bestial spirit of the air, land or water appears within 90 feet and fights for you for up to an hour, acting right after your turn on your spoken commands. A higher slot makes it stronger."
S["Warding Bond"] = "For an hour a willing creature you touch has +1 to Armor Class and saves and resistance to all damage while within 60 feet of you, but you take the same damage it takes."
S["Web"] = "Sticky webs fill a 20-foot cube within 60 feet for up to an hour: difficult terrain. A creature that enters or starts its turn there must pass a Dexterity save or be restrained; it can spend an action on an Athletics check against your spell save DC to break free. Fire burns the webs away."
S["Zone of Truth"] = "For 10 minutes a creature that enters or starts its turn in a 15-foot sphere within 60 feet must pass a Charisma save or be unable to tell a deliberate lie there. You know who failed; they may still stay silent or be evasive."
